# Travel summary

The daily allowance for domestic travel is sixty (60) EUR [[cite:obs-a459b9f6fda7794ac28b700f8a1760b167ff99a4 "The daily allowance for domestic travel is sixty (60) EUR."]]. Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director [[cite:obs-721617371ca593c0a407592d4618a3a72cfa6bb9 "Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director."]].
